{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-generic",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app ships no composer/autoload.php, so the server registers its generic loader for lib/ and looks every class up in the file system.",
        "  A composer/composer.json with config.vendor-dir \".\", config.optimize-autoloader true, a config.autoloader-suffix and autoload.psr-4 {\"OCA\\\\Absence\\\\\": \"../lib/\"} makes composer dump-autoload write composer/autoload.php with a class map; the code of the app does not change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "display-name-lookup",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "lib/Service/EmployeeJsonService.php:459",
        "lib/Service/EmployeeListService.php:134",
        "lib/Service/ImportService.php:127",
        "lib/Service/LeaveImportService.php:304",
        "lib/Service/ProfileService.php:150"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "5 places load a user with IUserManager::get() only to ask for the display name. IUserManager::getDisplayName(), there since Nextcloud 25, answers from a cache and loads no user.",
        "  lib/Service/EmployeeJsonService.php:459",
        "  lib/Service/EmployeeListService.php:134",
        "  lib/Service/ImportService.php:127",
        "  lib/Service/LeaveImportService.php:304",
        "  lib/Service/ProfileService.php:150"
      ],
      "folds": [
        {
          "at": 4,
          "count": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ocp-deprecated",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Controller/EmployeeController.php:145 OCP\\Collaboration\\Collaborators\\ISearch::search(): deprecated since Nextcloud 35; Use filteredSearch instead.",
        "lib/Controller/PageController.php:52 OCP\\AppFramework\\Http\\ContentSecurityPolicy: deprecated since Nextcloud 14; Use one of our stricter CSP policies",
        "lib/Migration/ConvertConfigTypes.php:80 OCP\\IAppConfig::deleteKey(): deprecated since Nextcloud 13; use method deleteAppValue of \\OCP\\IConfig"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "3 uses in 3 files of the public API that is deprecated in Nextcloud 34 to 36. The text of the tag names the replacement where it has one.",
        "  lib/Controller/EmployeeController.php:145 OCP\\Collaboration\\Collaborators\\ISearch::search(): deprecated since Nextcloud 35; Use filteredSearch instead.",
        "  lib/Controller/PageController.php:52 OCP\\AppFramework\\Http\\ContentSecurityPolicy: deprecated since Nextcloud 14; Use one of our stricter CSP policies",
        "  lib/Migration/ConvertConfigTypes.php:80 OCP\\IAppConfig::deleteKey(): deprecated since Nextcloud 13; use method deleteAppValue of \\OCP\\IConfig"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "transaction-manual",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Migration/ConvertConfigTypes.php:78",
        "lib/Service/EmployeeJsonService.php:143",
        "lib/Service/EmployeeService.php:128",
